#: src/postulo/templates/help/documents.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "<em>CVs and portfolios</em> are variants of your career record: each one chooses which entries to show, in which order, and how they are set. Correct an entry in <em>Your career</em> and every variant changes with it. <em>Letters</em> are the cover and motivation letters, with their own text."
msgstr "Is leaganacha de do thaifead gairme iad <em>CVanna agus punanna</em>: roghnaíonn gach ceann acu na hiontrálacha le taispeáint, cén t-ord, agus conas a leagtar amach iad. Ceartaigh iontráil in <em>Do ghairm</em> agus athraíonn gach leagan in éineacht léi. Is iad <em>Litreacha</em> na litreacha cumhdaigh agus spreagtha, lena dtéacs féin."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/documents.html
msgid "<em>Files</em> are documents you kept as they came: a diploma, a certificate, a reference letter. They can be marked as the proof of an entry of your career, and sent with an application. <em>Sent documents</em> are copies of what went out, exactly as it went, kept unchanged so that you can see later what you claimed."
msgstr "Is éard atá i gceist le <em>Comhaid</em> ná doiciméid a choinnigh tú mar a tháinig siad: dioplóma, teastas, litir theistiméireachta. Is féidir iad a mharcáil mar chruthúnas ar iontráil i do ghairm, agus iad a sheoladh le hiarratas. Is éard atá i gceist le <em>Doiciméid seolta</em> ná cóipeanna den mhéid a chuaigh amach, díreach mar a chuaigh sé, coinnithe gan athrú ionas go bhfeicfidh tú níos déanaí cad a mhaígh tú."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "<em>Headline</em> is a short professional title, such as “Backend engineer”. A CV that has a headline of its own prints that one instead."
msgstr "Is teideal gearr gairmiúil é <em>Teideal gairmiúil</em>, mar shampla “Innealtóir cúlchórais”. Má tá teideal gairmiúil dá chuid féin ag CV, priontálann sé an ceann sin ina ionad."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/career.html
msgid "<em>Import</em> reads a Europass CV; <em>Export</em> writes your details and your career as one file you can keep or move to another Postulo; <em>Preview</em> shows the whole record as a document, and <em>Your CVs</em> opens the variants made from it."
msgstr "Léann <em>Iompórtáil</em> CV Europass; scríobhann <em>Easpórtáil</em> do shonraí agus do ghairm mar chomhad amháin is féidir leat a choinneáil nó a bhogadh chuig Postulo eile; taispeánann <em>Réamhamharc</em> an taifead iomlán mar dhoiciméad, agus osclaíonn <em>Do CVanna</em> na leaganacha a rinneadh as."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/identifiers.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "<em>Kind</em> is the register the identifier belongs to, and <em>What goes where</em> shows what each one looks like. <em>Other</em> takes anything else, with a name you give it."
msgstr "Is é <em>Cineál</em> an clár lena mbaineann an t-aitheantóir, agus taispeánann <em>Cad a théann cén áit</em> an chuma atá ar gach ceann. Glacann <em>Eile</em> le haon rud eile, le hainm a thugann tú air."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/telephone_numbers.html
msgid "<em>Kind</em> says what the number is, and can be left blank. Choose <em>Other</em> and a box asks what to call it."
msgstr "Deir <em>Cineál</em> cén sórt uimhreach í, agus is féidir é a fhágáil bán. Roghnaigh <em>Eile</em> agus fiafróidh bosca cad is ainm di."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "<em>Language of your career record</em> says which language your experience, education and projects are typed in. A CV in another language shows what you have translated and says what it could not. It also decides which forms of address and pronouns the menus of <em>Your name</em> offer, and in which words. Left as it is, it follows the language you read Postulo in."
msgstr "Insíonn <em>Teanga do thaifead gairme</em> cén teanga ina bhfuil do thaithí, d’oideachas agus do thionscadail clóscríofa. Taispeánann CV i dteanga eile an méid atá aistrithe agat agus deir sé cad nach bhféadfadh sé. Cinneann sé freisin na foirmeacha beannachta agus na forainmneacha a thairgeann roghchláir <em>D’ainm</em>, agus cé na focail. Má fhágtar mar atá é, leanann sé an teanga ina léann tú Postulo."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/contact_block.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "<em>Location</em> is where you are, as a document should print it. Left blank, your documents print the town and country of your primary postal address, never the street, and the box shows that line in grey. The blank is what is kept, so making another address the primary changes what is printed without this page being saved again. Type something and that is printed instead."
msgstr "Is é <em>Suíomh</em> an áit a bhfuil tú, mar ba cheart do dhoiciméad é a phriontáil. Má fhágtar bán é, priontálann do dhoiciméid baile agus tír do phríomhsheolta poist, ní an tsráid riamh, agus taispeánann an bosca an líne sin i liath. Is é an bán a choinnítear, mar sin má dhéanann tú príomhsheoladh de sheoladh eile, athraíonn an méid a phriontáiltear gan an leathanach seo a shábháil arís. Clóscríobh rud éigin agus priontáiltear é sin ina ionad."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html
msgid "<em>Other</em> takes any web address, and a name to show for it; left blank, the name is the address's host. A card with no <em>Service</em> menu takes any address in the same way. Under a named service a row has no name of its own: the service is its name."
msgstr "Glacann <em>Eile</em> le haon seoladh gréasáin, agus ainm le taispeáint dó; má fhágtar bán é, is é óstríomhaire an tseolta an t-ainm. Glacann cárta gan roghchlár <em>Seirbhís</em> le haon seoladh ar an gcaoi chéanna. Faoi sheirbhís ainmnithe níl ainm dá chuid féin ag ró: is í an tseirbhís a ainm."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/import_csv_map.html
