#: src/postulo/templates/server/capture.html
msgid "A capture keeps what it read and throws the page away. It can keep the page as well: the source as it was parsed, and a rendering of the whole page. Both are off until you switch them on, because keeping a copy of somebody else's page is a decision to make on purpose. Each person then switches them on for their own captures; what is off here is off for everybody."
msgstr "Coinníonn gabháil an méid a léigh sí agus caitheann sí an leathanach uaithi. Is féidir léi an leathanach a choinneáil freisin: an fhoinse mar a parsáladh í, agus rindreáil den leathanach iomlán. Tá an dá rud múchta go dtí go gcasann tú air iad, mar gur cinneadh é cóip de leathanach duine eile a choinneáil ba cheart a dhéanamh d’aon ghnó. Casann gach duine air iad ansin dá ngabhálacha féin; an rud atá múchta anseo, tá sé múchta do chách."

