#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html
#, python-format
msgid "A package registers a source under the <code>%(group)s</code> entry-point group. A plugin appears as soon as it is installed, in every part of this instance and without a restart. Entry points are all it can bring: a plugin with pages or tables of its own has to be built into the image. A source that fails to load is logged and left out, and the built-in ones keep working."
msgstr "Cláraíonn pacáiste foinse faoin ngrúpa pointí iontrála <code>%(group)s</code>. Nochtann breiseán chomh luath agus atá sé suiteáilte, i ngach cuid den ásc seo agus gan atosú. Níl le tabhairt aige ach pointí iontrála: caithfear breiseán a bhfuil leathanaigh nó táblaí dá chuid féin aige a thógáil isteach san íomhá. Logáiltear foinse a dteipeann uirthi luchtú agus fágtar ar lár í, agus leanann na cinn ionsuite ag obair."

