#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr "Seiceáiltear comhad an bhreiseáin féin i gcoinne na suime seiceála a shínigh a chatalóg. Ní sheiceáiltear a riachtanais: faightear iad sin ó PyPI nuair a shuiteáiltear é, agus is é atá iontu cibé rud a sheirbheáiltear an lá sin. Má chuireann tú muinín i mbreiseán, cuireann tú muinín ina liosta riachtanas freisin. Ní shuiteálann Postulo ach rothaí tógtha (wheels), riamh pacáiste foinse a rithfeadh a chód féin le linn na suiteála, agus coinníonn sé taifead ar gach a tháinig."

