#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "A restore replaces everything on this instance with what is in the archive, so nothing else may be using the database while it runs. Stop the web service, the scheduler and the worker first, restore, and start them again. Run these on the machine that hosts the instance, not in this browser. The restore command is given <code>--force</code> because this instance already has accounts."
msgstr "Cuireann athbhunú an méid atá sa chartlann in ionad gach ruda sa suiteáil seo, mar sin ní féidir le haon rud eile a bheith ag úsáid an bhunachair sonraí fad atá sé ar siúl. Stop an tseirbhís ghréasáin, an sceidealóir agus an t-oibrí ar dtús, athbhunaigh, agus tosaigh arís iad. Rith iad seo ar an ríomhaire a óstálann an tsuiteáil, ní sa bhrabhsálaí seo. Tugtar <code>--force</code> don ordú athbhunaithe toisc go bhfuil cuntais sa suiteáil seo cheana."

