#: src/postulo/templates/settings/accessibility.html
#, python-format
msgid "Postulo is checked against WCAG 2.2 at level AA, in both themes, at 320 pixels and under Windows High Contrast; reduced motion and more contrast follow your system's own setting. What is checked, what is known not to work yet, and how to tell us when something does not work for you is on the <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">Accessibility page<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>."
msgstr "Seiceáiltear Postulo i gcoinne WCAG 2.2 ar leibhéal AA, sa dá théama, ag 320 picteilín agus faoi Windows High Contrast; leanann gluaiseacht laghdaithe agus codarsnacht bhreise socrú do chórais féin. Tá an méid a sheiceáiltear, an méid nach n-oibríonn fós, agus conas a insint dúinn nuair nach n-oibríonn rud éigin duit ar an <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">leathanach Inrochtaineachta<span class=\"sr-only\"> (osclaítear i gcluaisín nua é)</span></a>."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html
msgid "Postulo never opens a link on its own: not to check that it answers, not for an icon, not for a picture. The address is kept as you typed it, with https:// put in front where you left it out."
msgstr "Ní osclaíonn Postulo nasc as a stuaim féin riamh: ní chun a sheiceáil go bhfreagraíonn sé, ní do dheilbhín, ní do phictiúr. Coinnítear an seoladh mar a chlóscríobh tú é, le https:// curtha roimhe nuair a d’fhág tú ar lár é."

